    "description": "### Impact\r\nAn application level denial of service vulnerability has been identified in the username change functionality at try.discourse.org. The vulnerability allows attackers to cause noticeable server delays and resource exhaustion by sending large JSON payloads to the username preference endpoint PUT /u/<USERNAME>/preferences/username, resulting in degraded performance for other users and endpoints.\r\n\r\n### Workarounds\r\nUpgrade to the patched version.\r\n\r\n",
